{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassEndomorphism.ColorSpacetimeS5Factorization","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassEndomorphism.ColorSpacetimeS5Factorization","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Logic.Equiv.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Logic.Equiv.Fin.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Complex.Arg","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.OrderOfElement"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.winding_hom_to_finite_trivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.winding_hom_to_finite_trivial","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/color-spacetime-s5-factorization.lean#L105-L119","doc":"**Discreteness gate.** Any additive homomorphism from `ℝ` (the connected\nwinding parameter) to a finite group is trivial. The continuous\nframing / Chern–Simons winding cannot factor through the finite color\ngroup. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.em_phase_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.em_phase_mem","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/color-spacetime-s5-factorization.lean#L94-L96","doc":"the electromagnetic phase lies in `(-π, π]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.mass_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.mass_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/color-spacetime-s5-factorization.lean#L91-L92","doc":"mass is a nonnegative modulus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.trace_polar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.trace_polar","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/color-spacetime-s5-factorization.lean#L83-L89","doc":"**Polar decomposition of the trace scalar.** `tr_M = ‖tr_M‖·exp(i·arg)`:\nthe modulus is mass, the argument is the `U(1)` electromagnetic / framing\nphase. The multiplicative companion of the additive `Re + i·Im = 𝔙`\nreconstruction (`complex_volume_unification`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.spacetime_fixes_color","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.spacetime_fixes_color","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/color-spacetime-s5-factorization.lean#L75-L79","doc":"**Spacetime fixes color.** Dually, the spacetime factor `S₂` fixes every\ncolor index — the two sectors are orthogonal inside `S₅`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.color_fixes_spacetime","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.color_fixes_spacetime","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/color-spacetime-s5-factorization.lean#L67-L73","doc":"**Color fixes spacetime.** With the spacetime factor trivial, the color\npermutation `τ ∈ S₃` acts on `Fin 5` fixing every spacetime index\n`brIdx (Sum.inl i)`. This is \"the `S₃ ⊂ S₅` keeps the spacetime\ncoordinates invariant\". ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.colorSpacetimeEmbed_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.colorSpacetimeEmbed_injective","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/color-spacetime-s5-factorization.lean#L60-L65","doc":"**The factorisation is faithful:** `S₂ × S₃ ↪ S₅`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:color-spacetime-s5-factorization","label":"prop:color-spacetime-s5-factorization","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/color-spacetime-s5-factorization.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.colorSpacetimeEmbed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.colorSpacetimeEmbed","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/color-spacetime-s5-factorization.lean#L55-L58","doc":"The Galois embedding `S₂ × S₃ → S₅`: block-permute spacetime ⊕ color,\nthen relabel along `Fin 2 ⊕ Fin 3 ≃ Fin 5`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.spacetime_color_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.spacetime_color_card","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/color-spacetime-s5-factorization.lean#L49-L51","doc":"The trace algebra `H₂ ⊕ H₃` carries `2 + 3 = 5` irreps — the Bring\nfivefold. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassEndomorphism.brIdx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassEndomorphism.brIdx","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/color-spacetime-s5-factorization.lean#L46-L47","doc":"The Bring index decomposition `(spacetime ⊕ color) ≃ Fin 5`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}